      "title": "Dividend of ₹2.50 announced",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹2.50 is the same as last year. Ex-date: 10th July 2026 Payment date: 19th August 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.6%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.8%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is being paid despite the company being loss-making over the last 12 months. However, the dividend is well covered by cash flows (22% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 6.6% per year over the past 8 years and payments have been stable during that time.",
